WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.267
Okay,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.267
a number series!

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:10.933
Sixty,

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:11.600
fifty-four,

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.267
forty-eight,

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:12.933
forty-two,

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:14.267
and then...

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:16.267
what comes next?

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:16.933
A.

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:17.600
Thirty-six,

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.267
B.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:18.933
Thirty-eight,

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:19.600
C.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.267
Thirty-four,

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:21.600
or D.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.267
Thirty?

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:23.600
Five seconds!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.600
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.033
The answer is...

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.633
A,

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:34.233
thirty-six!

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.767
Each number goes down by six:

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:38.367
sixty,

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:38.933
fifty-four,

00:00:38.933 --> 00:00:39.533
forty-eight,

00:00:39.533 --> 00:00:40.133
forty-two,

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:43.667
so forty-two minus six is thirty-six.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:45.233
So,

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:47.267
are you smart or fart?

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:49.700
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.900
find your rank!

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:52.400
So,

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.800
how did you do?

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.167
Comment your score below,

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.533
and follow for more!
